fit_content = true
text = "Where you come in. Long gutting tables slick with old frost, drainage channels choked with rime, rows of rusted hooks swaying on a chain track that never stopped. One sodium lamp stutters overhead, throwing the hooks' shadows back and forth across the tiles. Loot here is thin and shallow — the picked-over crates and lockers nearest the door — but it is the safest air in the building and the room every run begins and, if you're lucky, ends beside."
